## Compact spacing between text and content (L2 subnav, sidebar, headers, cards)
================================================================================

Context: The UI had excessive dead whitespace between titles/text and content
surfaces. The L2 subnav had a 48px (3rem) rail height, the sidebar had generous
padding and a 16px gap to the content card, section headers floated high above
content with 0.5rem (or template mb-4) margins, and cards/headers had large
padding. The user asked to reduce these spaces across L2, the sidebar, and pages.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/global/css/main.css
   - Reduced `--ob-subnav-rail-height` from 3rem (48px) to 2.25rem (36px).
   - Tightened `.ob-subnav-nav` padding from 0.25rem to 0.15rem.
   - Reduced padding on `.ob-subnav-link`, `.ob-subnav-crumb`, `.ob-subnav-save-btn`,
     `.ob-subnav-close-btn`, `.ob-subnav-resume-btn`, `.ob-subnav-settings-return-link`,
     and `.ob-subnav-workspace-list`.
   - Tightened `#obSubnav .container-fluid` left padding from 0.5rem to 0.25rem to
     match the new sidebar outer gutter.
   - Compacted `.section-header`: `padding-top: 0.25rem`, `margin-bottom: 0.25rem !important`
     (overriding template `mb-4`/`mb-3` utilities), `h1..h4` margin reduced to 0.1rem,
     subtitle margin to 0.
   - Compacted `.card-header` (padding `0.5rem 0.75rem`, down from `1rem 1.25rem`),
     `.card-body` (padding `0.75rem`), and `.ob-tab-content` (padding `0.75rem`).
   - Compacted `.content-wrapper` (padding `0.75rem 1rem`, down from `2rem`),
     and `.page-header` (margin `0.75rem`, padding `0.25rem 0 0.5rem`).
2. src/front/static/global/css/sidebar-layout.css
   - Reduced `.sidebar-layout` outer padding (`0.15rem 0.25rem 0.25rem`, down from
     `0.25rem 0.5rem 0.5rem`) and inner gap between sidebar and content (`0.25rem`,
     down from `0.5rem`).
   - Reduced `.sidebar-content` horizontal padding (`0 0.25rem`, down from `0 0.5rem`),
     cutting the gap between sidebar nav links and content cards from 16px to 8px.
   - Tightened `.sidebar-nav` padding (`0.25rem 0`), `.sidebar-title` padding,
     `.nav-link` padding (`0.25rem 0.5rem`), margin, and icon gap (`0.35rem`).
   - Compacted `.sidebar-toggle` padding (`0.3rem 0.5rem`).
